 *   dag:Book, dag:Author, dag:Subject, dag:Run, dag:Activity,
 *   dag:Source, dag:Score
 *
 * Object properties (7):
 *   dag:hasAuthor, dag:hasSubject, dag:fromSource, dag:queriedIn,
 *   dag:shortlisted, dag:about, dag:publishedBy
